msgid "Play your daily guessing games"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.Dailies.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Dailies gathers daily guessing games like Wordle, Connections and Worldle in "
"one window, sorted into ten categories from words and logic to music, movies "
"and geography. Popular and Trending shelves, refreshed every week, show "
"which games are popular right now and which are on the rise. Star the games "
"you play every day to keep them together in Favorites."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.Dailies.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Games open in a built-in browser that keeps your streaks between sessions, "
"or in your default web browser if you prefer. Dailies needs no account and "
"collects no data: your favorites stay on your device, and the app only "
"downloads the game list, this week's shelves and the games' icons from "
"GitHub, and the game pages you open."
msgstr ""

